      "refersTo": "brief-output",
      "description": "The paper output on olive; its complete text remains in normal flow.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-output-context\"><div class=\"ds-output\"><div class=\"ds-output-heading\"><span>Your listening brief</span><span class=\"ds-duration\">60 min</span></div><div class=\"ds-brief\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Your listening brief\" tabindex=\"0\">Make me a 60-minute Apple Music playlist for: the long way home.\n\nWarm, textured and a little unexpected. Mostly discoveries, with a few familiar anchors.\n\nNo live versions. Avoid consecutive songs by the same artist.\n\nChoose exact recordings, explain the listening flow, and show me the playlist before creating it. Suggest an original cover direction too.</div><button class=\"ds-output-copy\" type=\"button\">Copy listening brief</button><p class=\"ds-output-help\">Try it with Groovectl in your agent. This demo composes a brief; it does not access an account.</p></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-output-context{padding:1rem;background:var(--olive,#41472e);}.ds-output{background:var(--paper,#faf7ef);color:var(--ink,#29291f);border-radius:16px;padding:1.7rem;font-family:var(--font-body,\"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif);line-height:1.6;}.ds-output-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:650;padding-bottom:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#d4d0c2);}.ds-duration{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--muted,#626151);}.ds-brief{display:block;width:100%;min-height:20rem;padding:1.3rem 0 1rem;border:0;color:var(--ink,#29291f);background:transparent;font-family:\"Fraunces Variable\",Georgia,serif;font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-output-copy{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.8rem;min-height:48px;padding:.75rem 1.15rem;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid transparent;font-family:var(--font-body,\"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif);font-size:.95rem;font-weight:650;line-height:1.4;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s,color .18s;width:100%;background:var(--berry,#a82646);color:var(--paper,#faf7ef);}.ds-output-copy:hover{background:var(--berry-dark,#841d36);}.ds-output :focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--berry,#a82646);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-output-help{margin:1rem 0 0;color:var(--muted,#626151);font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.5;min-height:2.6em;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-output{padding:1.3rem;}.ds-brief{font-size:1.2rem;}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-output-copy{transition:none!important;animation:none!important;}}"
    }
